{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026z4L8wvLwMa1795512898.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>電動車在香港日趨普及，數量已超過18萬架，因損耗而需要退役的電池數量，粗略估算由今年約1,300公噸，逐步上升至4年後約6,700公噸。若不妥善處理，就會對環境造成嚴重污染。</p><p></p><p>當局提出電池生產者責任計劃，建議向電動車供應商徵收循環再造徵費，徵費是用作支援、回收和處理退役電動車電池，以電池重量計算，起始水平是每公斤6元，一般私家車配備500公斤，即要支付3,000元，之後每年遞增。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261124_QQ.BATTERY.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vttg9EXcAi1795512997.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>回收商會將退役電池製成「再生黑粉」，提取鋰、銅、鈷等珍貴金屬，或將狀態較好的電池，製作成「二次應用電池產品」，例如用作數據中心後備儲能系統或工地流動電力系統。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261124_QQ.BATTERY.CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026h1eyfOCotv1795513012.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>根據獨立顧問的評估，電動車電池生產者責任計劃，預計將為本地生產總值帶來每年約6,600萬元的附加價值。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261124_QQ.BATTERY.CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JoCwHrTrgc1795513023.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，計劃亦會為廢物管理及回收行業，創造超過100個全職職位。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12745-%E4%BB%A5%E8%89%B2%E5%88%97%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9B%E6%8A%95%E7%9F%B3%E7%B4%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.295002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:37:13.223437+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:17.487274+00:00","content_hash":"02579a38ff5cb8a49974f33175a3c8f458bc77ee5c898f44b1f5f8e74fadfe3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.295002+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}